The '''Magpie impling''' is the fourth highest [[impling]] that can be caught in the [[Impetuous Impulses]] [[minigame]], and are located throughout [[Puro-Puro]] and [[Gielinor]]. Players need at least 65 [[Hunter]] to capture this type of impling (75 barehanded). Capturing a Magpie impling will grant the player either 44 Hunter experience if caught in Puro-Puro, or 216 Hunter experience if caught outside of Puro-Puro, throughout Gielinor.

The Magpie impling is one of the most sought-after implings, alongside the [[Ninja impling]] and [[Dragon impling]], due to the value of the loot from the Magpie impling being decently high.

==Rarity==
{{Main|Impling#Spawn_mechanics}}
On the Gielinor surface, magpie implings have a 2/100 chance to appear out of a mid-tier invisible spawn, as well as a 50/101 chance of appearing out of a high-tier invisible spawn. In Puro-Puro, magpie implings have a 114/301 chance to emerge from one of the high-tier invisible spawns.

For a more detailed breakdown of impling spawn mechanics, see the main article.

